---
import Button from "../common/Button.astro";
---

<section class="section section--surface founder-section" id="about">
	<div class="card card--soft founder-card">
		<h2 class="text-headline-lg">Practical systems built by someone who understands software, operations, and business.</h2>
		<p class="text-body-section">
			ArkSystems is led by a technical founder with experience building SaaS products,
			workflow systems, automation, and business operations. The focus is simple:
			understand the workflow, prove the business case, and implement systems
			that make work easier and more measurable.
		</p>
		<Button href="#contact" variant="primary" showArrow>Talk Through Your Workflow</Button>
	</div>
</section>
